  "alt": "A specified region stacks the engineering obligation above scaffolding. The obligation boundary is fixed by the engineering problem; the specification boundary depends on both obligation and agent capability. Below are implementation choices left to the agent. An upward capability arrow indicates that greater capability can reduce required scaffolding.",
